    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Losing your parents at a young age led you to venture abroad. Now, as an adult, you return to your hometown to take the reins of your late parents' company. As you explore your options for the future, you'll unlock new scenes and encounters, all while being surrounded by intriguing and beautiful women, with even more surprises in store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325750/extras/ea8a6471a04b2ffa6b34e4bc22dd9aee.avif?t=1736919165\" width=616 height=375 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this story from the <u><i><strong>first-person perspective</strong></i></u> of the main character, incorporating elements of a <u><i><strong>third-person viewpoint</strong></i></u>, such as flashbacks and various scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide whether to pursue the role of CEO or begin your career at the entry level and work your way up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325750/extras/8b7c731a475dc98c1038ea720b242adb.avif?t=1736919165\" width=616 height=375 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the intricacies of your world, you will  unlock a distinctive gallery featuring a diverse array of women, accompanied by brief descriptions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325750/extras/c67b469e304dbb8060c97b9b7e4d55db.avif?t=1736919165\" width=616 height=374 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Losing your parents at a young age led you to venture abroad. Now, as an adult, you return to your hometown to take the reins of your late parents' company. As you explore your options for the future, you'll unlock new scenes and encounters, all while being surrounded by intriguing and beautiful women, with even more surprises in store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325750/extras/ea8a6471a04b2ffa6b34e4bc22dd9aee.avif?t=1736919165\" width=616 height=375 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this story from the <u><i><strong>first-person perspective</strong></i></u> of the main character, incorporating elements of a <u><i><strong>third-person viewpoint</strong></i></u>, such as flashbacks and various scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide whether to pursue the role of CEO or begin your career at the entry level and work your way up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325750/extras/8b7c731a475dc98c1038ea720b242adb.avif?t=1736919165\" width=616 height=375 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the intricacies of your world, you will  unlock a distinctive gallery featuring a diverse array of women, accompanied by brief descriptions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325750/extras/c67b469e304dbb8060c97b9b7e4d55db.avif?t=1736919165\" width=616 height=374 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "The Last Progenitor is an adult visual novel that emphasizes player choices. You can decide whether to take the helm as the CEO of your late parents' company or begin from the ground up and work your way to the top. Your journey will be rich with intrigue, betrayals, and captivating women.",
